	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Open a new window of an app on the current Space without switching Spaces.

Keyword: newwin

Features:
- Lists all .app bundles found by Spotlight
- Client-side filtering by Alfred (instant after first load)
- 5-second cache for fast keystroke response
- Shows app icons
- Creates a new window via the app's own new-window menu item while backgrounded, then focuses it
- Falls back to Cmd+N with a notification for apps without a discoverable new-window menu item</string>
